## Results

- Achieved an overall accuracy of 94.3% in thyroid cancer risk prediction.
- Successfully combined ultrasound image analysis and clinical data using a multimodal AI approach.
- CNN model effectively extracted image-based features from thyroid ultrasound scans.
- Random Forest model accurately analyzed clinical parameters such as TSH, T3, and T4.
- Weighted fusion technique improved prediction reliability and reduced diagnostic variability.
- The system classified patients into:
  - Low Risk
  - Medium Risk
  - High Risk
- Developed a user-friendly web interface for patient registration, prediction, and report generation.
- The proposed system supports early diagnosis and assists doctors in clinical decision-making.
